 r←space GetAcreItemName filename;buff
⍝ acre is peculiar about "filename": if it cannot establish the item name,
⍝ it might return something strange that results in ¯1 ←→ ⎕NC on it.
 r←''
 :If ⎕NEXISTS filename
     buff←⊃⎕SE.acre.Itemname F.EnforceSlash filename
 :AndIf 0≤⎕NC buff
     r←space,'.',buff
 :EndIf
